WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.204
JEREMY RENNER
Clint Barton is

00:00:03.254 --> 00:00:06.188
one of the original six Avengers.
And because of this Hawkeye show,

00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:10.109
we get to share together all of who
Clint Barton is in a very exciting way.

00:00:10.159 --> 00:00:12.070
NEWS REPORTER
The Ronin vigilante was spotted...

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.209
CLINT BARTON
I'll be home for Christmas. I promise.

00:00:15.456 --> 00:00:17.081
RHYS THOMAS
Hawkeye's compelling because there's

00:00:17.131 --> 00:00:21.731
a sense that this ordinary guy is
just driven by this sense of duty

00:00:21.781 --> 00:00:25.097
more than anything. He doesn't have
the protection of superpowers.

00:00:25.147 --> 00:00:28.350
I find it interesting that you get to
join him where he essentially found

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.002
the peace that he's always wanted.
But you know that there's been this

00:00:32.052 --> 00:00:33.345
price that's been paid.

00:00:35.621 --> 00:00:36.453
CLINT BARTON
Ow.

00:00:37.322 --> 00:00:39.708
BRAD WINDERBAUM
Clint has always been the human face

00:00:39.758 --> 00:00:42.867
on the Avengers. He has all these
things about him that I think

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:45.776
parallel a lot of people's
true-life experiences.

00:00:45.826 --> 00:00:48.895
And it's amazing what happens
when you let, you know,

00:00:48.945 --> 00:00:53.239
actors like Jeremy Renner really have
the space to explore their character.

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:54.895
LILA BARTON
This the first Christmas

00:00:54.945 --> 00:00:57.284
we've had together in years.

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:58.522
CLINT BARTON
I love you guys.

00:00:58.688 --> 00:00:59.591
Come on, bud!

00:00:59.641 --> 00:01:01.734
TRINH TRAN
Jeremy is very much into the truth

00:01:01.784 --> 00:01:05.877
about the character. Having been
Clint Barton for the last ten years,

00:01:05.927 --> 00:01:08.260
he knows this character inside out.

00:01:08.689 --> 00:01:09.607
JEREMY RENNER
It's been an exciting,

00:01:09.658 --> 00:01:11.163
exhilarating sort of ride.

00:01:11.213 --> 00:01:15.518
And it's hard to quantify
what it's meant for me and my career.

00:01:15.568 --> 00:01:19.819
But when I think of the MCU and my
experiences playing this character,

00:01:19.869 --> 00:01:21.930
it becomes much more
of a personal journey.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:24.918
And I'm excited to
see where it goes.

